# Brainana example dataset

A small, ready-to-run BIDS dataset used to demo the Brainana macaque MRI
preprocessing pipeline. It contains a single subject and session:

    sub-example/ses-001/
    ├── anat/
    │   ├── sub-example_ses-001_run-1_T1w.nii.gz   (+ .json)
    │   ├── sub-example_ses-001_run-2_T1w.nii.gz   (+ .json)
    │   └── sub-example_ses-001_run-1_T2w.nii.gz   (+ .json)
    └── func/
        ├── sub-example_ses-001_task-rest_run-1_bold.nii.gz   (+ .json)
        └── sub-example_ses-001_task-rest_run-2_bold.nii.gz   (+ .json)

How to run this dataset through Brainana is documented under "Try a demo" in the Docs:
https://brainana.readthedocs.io
